OL,3,GNEWSATribute to 'much-loved' teen
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to a
OL,7,F"much-loved" teenager who died in a
OL,8,Fcrash.
OL,10,FConnor Bradley, 17, from Porthleven,
OL,11,FCornwall, died in a car that crashed
OL,12,Finto a building on Sunday.
OL,14,FHis father Stephen Bradley said: "We
OL,15,Fare absolutely devastated and
OL,16,Fheartbroken at the loss of Connor."
OL,18,FDevon and Cornwall Police said it was
OL,19,Fcontinuing to appeal for information
OL,20,Fabout the crash, which happened on the
OL,21,FA39, near Truro, and left three other
OL,22,Fteenagers injured.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
